## 5. AI Agent Stability Improvements

### Failure Point Matrix

| Failure | Detection | Response | Already Handled? |
|---|---|---|---|
| Gemini returns invalid JSON | `model_validate_json` throws | Returns `action: "unknown"` fallback | ✅ Yes (`agent.py` line 59–69) |
| Gemini timeout (>15s) | `request_options={"timeout": 15}` | Returns fallback | ✅ Yes |
| Unknown action field | `AgentAction` enum | Pydantic rejects it → fallback | ✅ Yes (after our audit fix) |
| Confidence < 0.70 | Frontend check | Don't show confirmation card | ⚠️ Needs frontend logic |
| Empty RAG context | `build_context` returns "No products" | Agent still responds | ✅ Yes |
| Missing SKU from agent | Backend `tools.py` raises `ValueError` | Returns 400 error | ✅ Yes |
| Gemini rate limit | Exception caught | Returns fallback | ✅ Yes |
| Sarvam STT failure | Frontend must catch | Show "Couldn't hear you" | ⚠️ Needs frontend logic |
| Sarvam TTS no audio | Browser autoplay policy | Only play after user tap | ⚠️ Needs frontend logic |

