## 7. Failure Scenarios + Minimal Fixes

| # | Scenario | Cause | Fix |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | Frontend can't reach backend | CORS blocks Vercel domain | Add exact Vercel URL to `FRONTEND_URL` env var (or use `allow_origins=["*"]` for demo) |
| 2 | Agent returns malformed JSON | Gemini adds markdown backticks | Already handled: `response_mime_type="application/json"` forces clean JSON |
| 3 | Empty inventory in RAG | Wrong `shop_id` | Hardcode `shop_01` in frontend `.env.local` to match seeded data |
| 4 | Backend crash on null fields | Missing null checks | Already fixed: all `AgentResponse` fields have string/int defaults, fallback returns safe values |
| 5 | Supabase connection drops | Pooler idle timeout | Already fixed: `pool_pre_ping=True` in database.py |
| 6 | Gemini rate limit during demo | Too many requests | Add 1s debounce on frontend send button. Backend fallback already returns safe response |
| 7 | Sarvam TTS plays no audio | Browser autoplay policy | Trigger TTS playback only inside a user-initiated event handler (button click) |
| 8 | Low confidence on every request | System prompt too vague | Add explicit scoring examples: "If exact SKU match + exact quantity = 0.95. If partial match = 0.6" |

